PROSE SUMMARY (context, not a substitute for the structured log above)
---------------------------------------------------------------------
27-turn grind. Bandit ran a wide multi-Pengullet/Reptyro Cryst/Relaxaurus/Jormuntide board with Pengullet Rocket Launcher buffs, but nearly every attack was nullified by Jsn's deep interrupt suite (Cryolinx x4, Reindrix x3, Foxparks x3, Pyrin Noct, Bushi). Jsn's small chip attackers (Suzaku, Flambelle, Bushi, Lamball) whittled Bandit down turn by turn (10->8->7->5->4->3) while Bandit's own Pump-Action Shotgun self-damage triggers (1200 to own Pals) repeatedly weakened Bandit's board. Jsn also used Bushi as a repeatable "attack then return to hand" interrupt-bounce three times (turns 12, 22-equivalent, 25) to reset it as a blocker/interrupt fodder. Bandit's Relaxaurus attacks were nullified 4 separate times (turns 19, 20, 23, 26) by Jsn's interrupt chain, and eventually Bandit surrendered still at 3 life to Jsn's 10.


